  "m2_criterion": {
    "id": "M2_source_attested",
    "definition": "Current rights-cleared real Maldives Post five-character string assignments with leading zeroes, stable source identity, island/locality and atoll/postal-region scope, original Dhivehi/Latin fields, validity semantics, edition, acquisition time, schema and SHA-256. UPU 09/2004 tables are dated syntax: duplicate 20XXX patterns across groups cannot become a unique geographic key or current allocation. A permitted official postal boundary needs an explicit postal-authority relation; otherwise geometry remains none. Any OneMap island administrative join stays derived with exact input rights, stable reviewed crosswalk, source CRS, topology and uncertainty. FCODE, OBJECTID, island labels and string coordinate attributes are not postcodes or civic/building identities. House numbers/buildings require independent permitted explicit civic-address/building relations. Validate actual coverage, exceptions, privacy and reproducible transformation; publish only approved immutable digest-pinned data artifacts and verify their downloaded hashes and actual MV AGID loader/API. Schema metadata, public access, empty licenseInfo, dynamic service timestamps and synthetic tests never establish M2."
  },
